stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> PROPOSED
  PROPOSED --> EVALUATING
  EVALUATING --> DENIED: any PHAP LE LY TINH DENY
  EVALUATING --> NEEDS_INPUT: UNKNOWN or stale context
  NEEDS_INPUT --> EVALUATING: new evidence or revision
  EVALUATING --> READ_ONLY: C0
  EVALUATING --> AUTHORIZED: C1 and published policy
  EVALUATING --> WAITING_NOTICE: C2_NOTIFY approved closed list
  WAITING_NOTICE --> NOTICE_PENDING: DELIVERED with exact digest
  WAITING_NOTICE --> NEEDS_INPUT: missing delivery
  NOTICE_PENDING --> VETOED: veto wins dispatch lock
  NOTICE_PENDING --> NEEDS_INPUT: stale preconditions
  NOTICE_PENDING --> AUTHORIZED: window elapsed no veto under lock
  EVALUATING --> WAITING_APPROVAL: C2_APPROVE or C3
  WAITING_APPROVAL --> DENIED: refused
  WAITING_APPROVAL --> AUTHORIZED: valid exact authority and digest
  AUTHORIZED --> CONSUMED: atomic durable command
  AUTHORIZED --> NEEDS_INPUT: changed facts rules authority
  NOTICE_PENDING --> EXPIRED: TTL
  WAITING_APPROVAL --> EXPIRED: TTL
  AUTHORIZED --> EXPIRED: TTL
  READ_ONLY --> [*]
  DENIED --> [*]
  VETOED --> [*]
  EXPIRED --> [*]
  CONSUMED --> [*]
